  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2024/04/IMG_20240402_185343.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(10 fotos) La vesprada d&#39;aquest dimarts, 2 d&#39;abril, s&#39;ha inaugurat el nou Espai d&#39;Oci, als baixos de les piscines de Suera. Durant Pasqua estar&agrave; obert tots els dies d&#39;11 a 21 hores. Despr&eacute;s, de divendres a diumenge, de 17 a 21 hores. Tamb&eacute; s&#39;ha jugat un campionat de futbol&iacute;.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugespaiocisuera/IMG_20240402_185143.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240402_185143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugespaiocisuera/IMG_20240402_185154.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240402_185154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugespaiocisuera/IMG_20240402_185209.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240402_185209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugespaiocisuera/IMG_20240402_185224.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240402_185224\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugespaiocisuera/IMG_20240402_185343.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240402_185343\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugespaiocisuera/IMG_20240402_185822.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240402_185822\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugespaiocisuera/IMG_20240402_185838.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20240402_185838\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f2